# ThreadSanitizer suppressions. Every entry names its reason. An entry for our own code needs either a
# fix or an explanation of synchronization TSan can't see; "benign race" is not a reason.

# AudioToolbox's parameter refresher reads an AUv3's parameterTree on its own thread. The tree is set
# on main while the unit is created, long before AudioToolbox hands the unit to the refresher, and
# that hand-off happens inside AudioToolbox, which is uninstrumented, so TSan sees no ordering.
race:AUScheduledParameterRefresher2::invalidateParameter
